cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these results, please cite the preprint below."
title: "Weak pre-before-post pair biases sort synaptic weights in a conductance-based model of spontaneous network bursting"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered computational study of whether spontaneous population
  bursts reinforce existing synaptic weight differences, with an
  observational test of the resulting prediction on archived cortical
  culture recordings.
